Summary of changes made to the original work:

  - Group auto-join: a group can request access with a command; the owner
    approves it with one tap in a private chat.
  - Voice transcription hook: incoming voice notes can be transcribed by an
    external command configured through an environment variable.
  - Daemon mode and session bridge: the poller runs as a long-lived process
    and writes events to a file; the session replays them, so a session
    restart no longer costs incoming messages.
  - Reply quotes: the message a user replied to is passed along, so the
    assistant answers about the quoted text.
  - Hardening: the bridge replays only an allowlist of methods, the event
    journal and its directory are created with restrictive permissions, and
    bot tokens are stripped from error output.

